<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the $926,250</p>
<p>Italian Open women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seed):</p>
<p>12-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Francesca Lubiani (Italy) beat 4-Anke Huber (Germany) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>14-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 3-6 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) beat 16-Sandrine Testud (France) 7-6 (7-4) 6-0</p>
<p>6-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Anna Kournikova (Russia) 6-2 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>5-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Nicole Arendt (U.S.) 7-6 (7-2) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>10-Mary Pierce (France) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>11-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-1 6-3</p>
<p>8-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Florencia Labat (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>2-Arantxa Sanchez-Vicario (Spain) beat Paola Suarez (Argentina) 6-2 6-2 13-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) 6-4 6-3 Joannette Kruger (South Africa) beat 9-Brenda Schultz McCarthy (Netherlands) 6-2 7-5  </p>
<p>3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
